#: processes/initialize-harness.bpmn:75
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Performed against the data store — a git repository, through the git CLI or a forge API. The instructions are at a PREDETERMINED spot on the harness: `<stub>/docs/bootstrap/initialization.md`, the same for every harness, which is what lets a Bootstrapping Agent be pointed at one nobody has written yet."
msgstr ""

